.TH SAMPLE-CONFIG-SET 1
.SH NAME
sample\-config\-set \- Sets one key.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsample config set\fR [\fIoptions\fR] \fIstring\fR [\fIstring\fR]
.br
\fBsample put\fR [\fIoptions\fR] \fIstring\fR [\fIstring\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets one key.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIstring\fR
The key.
.TP
[\fIstring\fR]
The value; the key is removed without one.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR, \fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite without asking.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show version.
